WEBVTT

00:09:58.208 --> 00:10:02.601
I think the thing that we have
to hold on to is other people.

00:10:02.625 --> 00:10:07.059
And I know that is a small thing
made up of small moments,

00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:10.518
but I think it is one tiny,
tiny sliver of light

00:10:10.542 --> 00:10:12.351
in all the darkness.

00:10:12.375 --> 00:10:13.643
Thank you.

00:10:13.667 --> 00:10:18.184
(Applause)

00:10:18.208 --> 00:10:19.476
Thank you.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:23.375
(Applause)